@dev Check if an address has a specific role
@param role The role to check
@param account The address to check
@return Whether the address has the role

@dev Check if an address is authorized as a merchant
@param merchant The merchant address to check
@return Whether the address is an authorized merchant

@dev Check if an address is registered as a borrower
@param borrower The borrower address to check
@return Whether the address is a registered borrower

@dev Set display name for a merchant
@param merchant Address of the merchant
@param name Display name (e.g., "Starbucks", "Amazon", etc.)

@dev Get transaction history for a borrower
@param borrower Address of the borrower
@param limit Maximum number of transactions to return (0 = all)
@param offset Number of transactions to skip (for pagination)
@return transactions Array of transactions

@dev Get latest transactions for a borrower
@param borrower Address of the borrower
@param count Number of latest transactions to return
@return transactions Array of latest transactions

@dev Get transaction count for a borrower
@param borrower Address of the borrower
@return count Total number of transactions

@dev Get merchant display name
@param merchant Address of the merchant
@return name Display name of the merchant

@dev Execute a spend transaction
@param borrower Address of the borrower
@param merchant Address of the merchant
@param amount Amount to spend

@dev Process a repayment from borrower
@param amount Amount to repay in stablecoin
@param stablecoin Address of stablecoin used for repayment

@dev Confirm off-chain repayment (fiat payments, bank transfers, etc.)
@param borrower Address of the borrower who made the payment
@param amount Amount repaid in USD (18 decimals)
@param txHash Off-chain transaction hash for verification
@notice Can only be called by oracle role after off-chain payment verification

@dev Get available credit for a borrower
@param borrower Address of the borrower
@return availableCredit Amount of credit available for spending

@dev Get borrower profile information
@param borrower Address of the borrower
@return profile Complete borrower profile

@dev Check if a merchant is authorized
@param merchant Address to check
@return Whether the merchant is authorized

@dev Check if a borrower is registered and active
@param borrower Address to check
@return Whether the borrower is registered and active

@dev Update credit scoring parameters (admin only)
@param _baseCreditLimit New base credit limit in USD (18 decimals)
@param _initialCreditScore New initial credit score (100-1000)
@param _maxCreditScore New maximum credit score
@param _minCreditScore New minimum credit score
@param _scoreIncreasePerRepayment Score increase per successful repayment
@param _scoreDecreasePerLatePayment Score decrease per late payment
@param _creditLimitMultiplier Credit limit multiplier for score improvements

@dev Update score adjustment parameters (admin only)
@param _scoreIncreasePerRepayment Score increase per successful repayment
@param _scoreDecreasePerLatePayment Score decrease per late payment

@dev Calculate new credit score on spending
@param borrower Address of the borrower
@return newScore Updated credit score

@dev Calculate new credit score on repayment
@param borrower Address of the borrower
@return newScore Updated credit score

@dev Calculate new credit limit based on credit score
@param borrower Address of the borrower
@return newLimit Updated credit limit
